-- Enrichment Batch 40 (2026-10-30): resolve the Pass 133 re-scope flag on record 761.
-- The Tasmanian International Scholarship (TIS, 25%) is DISCONTINUED for new applicants:
-- UTAS's 2027 automatically-assessed line-up (hub + both scheme pages fetched first-hand
-- today, sources 3181-3183) is Aurora Excellence 50%, International Merit 30%, Alumni/
-- Family 25%, Access 20%, partner-college 20% and the Maritime College bursary 25-30%.
-- 761 is retired; the two individually verified general successors are added as their own
-- records at reliability 10: 1004 (Tasmanian International Merit, 30%, automatic) and
-- 1005 (Tasmanian Aurora Excellence, 50%, by invitation; rounds JSON, first close
-- 2026-11-15). Access 20% and Alumni/Family 25% deliberately not catalogued (access/
-- country- and alumni-restricted, not general international merit routes). Percentage
-- amounts follow records 676/761: award_amount = published percentage, AUD/year/variable,
-- USD 0. min_gpa/min_ielts NULL on the new records (ATAR-equivalent / 7-point benchmarks
-- are scale-ambiguous and live in the narrative). Notes appends are replay-once; new IDs
-- are explicit. Writes were executed strictly sequentially (Pass 133 pool-exhaustion
-- lesson).

